# SwarmWorld — LLM agent proposals (optional, off by default).
# The deterministic heuristic engine runs with zero configuration; LLM mode
# is enabled in-app (header Cpu toggle) with a BYOK gateway token stored in
# the browser, or via this env var at build time:
# VITE_YRKA_GATEWAY_TOKEN="sk-..."
# VITE_YRKA_GATEWAY_BASE_URL="https://gateway.yrka.io/v1"
